cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Neural Tidepool in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Neural Tidepool: interactive experiments in computational neuroscience"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, browser-based laboratory for computational neuroscience.
  Lab 1 simulates a leaky integrate-and-fire neuron with an exact event-driven
  integrator, an independent Python reference engine, guided experimental
  protocols, and reproducible experiment files.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Yunmo
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yunmo0121/Neural-Tidepool"
url: "https://yunmo0121.github.io/Neural-Tidepool/"
keywords:
  - computational neuroscience
  - leaky integrate-and-fire
  - spiking neuron
  - simulation
  - reproducibility
  - education
